# DEFINITION

Retry a failed operation after [adjusting delay](https://example.org/backoff).

# CONTEXT

A transient failure may succeed on retry.

# PROBLEM

A single attempt can fail transiently.

# SOLUTION

Repeat the operation under a bounded policy.

# CONSEQUENCES

Retries add load.
